      "Known exact signature means m(1,0)=3/5 and m(0,1)=2/5 for every store.",
      "Per-store outcome bounds [0,1].",
      "Own mean-order restriction: m_i(1,s)>=m_i(0,s).",
      "Peer mean-order restriction: increasing any neighbor's treatment does not lower m_i.",
      "No additional coupling constraints."
