    "sharpness_argument": "The lower endpoint is attained when m_i(1,1)=3/5 and m_i(0,0)=2/5 for every store. The upper endpoint is attained when m_i(1,1)=1 and m_i(0,0)=0 for every store. Both are compatible with the declared means, bounds and order restrictions, so the interval is sharp relative to the declared finite model.",
